WEBVTT

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:33.793
as the place that welcomed generations
of newcomers to the United States.

00:03:34.585 --> 00:03:35.920
It did that,

00:03:35.962 --> 00:03:39.632
but it was also an immigration prison

00:03:39.632 --> 00:03:42.551
with an ironic view
of the Statue of Liberty.

00:03:43.844 --> 00:03:48.683
By the 1950s, the Ellis Island facility
needed to be repaired,

00:03:48.724 --> 00:03:50.393
replaced or discarded.

00:03:51.143 --> 00:03:55.314
The government of the war hero
turned Republican president,

00:03:55.314 --> 00:03:57.108
Dwight Eisenhower,

00:03:57.108 --> 00:03:58.901
decided to shut it down.